            "notes": "**Like Round 2, your goal in Round 3 should be amassing 11,000 cash to keep your current build and to buy Booster Jets.**\n\n## Booster Jets\nThis is the next purple I always try to rush. It\u2019s easy to stack up Weapon Power with blue quality items, but Attack Speed is a little harder to come by. At this stage, it is a better choice than other items like Hardlight Accelerator.\n\nIf you fail to gather 11,000 cash in Round 3, do your math and figure out the best way to stack up on equal Weapon Power and Attack Speed with the Mid-Game Item List. \nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ume5t5GKmDI-19VMqb8PMdN0-tyZAKWo6h3-IcPMhLc/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.mm9mnczg0zvr",
